There the idea, while still freedom centered, has generated many ideas from "Ten Acres and Freedom" to the "Back to the Land" contingent. Talk and ideas are prevalent, but not published attempts are on-going. That, however, may be more an effect of security than real lack of attempts. Still, it's a startin' place.
